Victoria 3 Analysis Artifacts - Licensing and Provenance Notice

Provenance

This repository collects artifacts generated from or based on data read from
a lawfully installed copy of Victoria 3 using victoria3-analysis:

- tables/ holds parsed and transformed game-data snapshots and analytical
  results calculated from those snapshots.
- figures/ holds visualizations and graphs generated from those tables and
  analytical results.

Paradox Interactive AB and/or its licensors own rights in Victoria 3 and its
game content. The repository author does not claim rights in that underlying
content.

License boundary

This is a separate repository from victoria3-analysis. The GPL-3.0-or-later
license of victoria3-analysis does not apply to this repository's contents,
including the complete artifact files under tables/ and figures/.

This notice grants no new license over artifact files and no rights in
Paradox-owned content. Any right to use or redistribute that content must
come from Paradox's terms or applicable law.

Applicable terms

The artifacts are provided free of charge as unofficial, non-commercial
analytical material. Their use and redistribution remain subject to the
Paradox Interactive User Agreement and applicable law:

https://legal.paradoxplaza.com/eula

Sections 1 (License) and 5 (User Generated Content) address ownership,
non-commercial use and publication, and the limits of creators' rights in
game-derived content. Consult the current agreement for the applicable terms.

